{"id":"4f75e1125f61f318","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-sigma-homomorphism.md","title":"Σ同态与同构","display":"df-sigma-homomorphism — Σ同态与同构","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-sigma-homomorphism","aliases":["56-df-sigma-homomorphism"],"display":"df-sigma-homomorphism — Σ同态与同构","depends_on":["[[56-df-structure]]"],"source_section":"7.2.1(i)","source_pages":"266","source_ocr_blocks":[287],"source_statement_status":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"not-applicable"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-sigma-homomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-sigma-homomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-sigma-homomorphism — Σ同态与同构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3544e74f0e48d8ac\" href=\"?note=3544e74f0e48d8ac\" title=\"56-df-structure\">56-df-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"7.2.1(i)"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"266"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>287</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"statement-compared-to-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=(A,I)\">\\(\\mathfrak A=(A,I)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B=(B,J)\">\\(\\mathfrak B=(B,J)\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3544e74f0e48d8ac\" href=\"?note=3544e74f0e48d8ac\" title=\"56-df-structure\">56-df-structure</a> 的非空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span>-代数。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B^A\">\\(B^A\\)</span> 为所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\">\\(A\\to B\\)</span> 函数的集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h\\in B^A\">\\(h\\in B^A\\)</span>。记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vec a=(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)\">\\(\\vec a=(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)\\)</span>，函数作用于元组的写法包含零元输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"()\">\\(()\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\Longleftrightarrow\nh\\in B^A\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in A^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}\\;\n\\bigl(h(I(f)(\\vec a))=J(f)((h(a_i))_{1\\le i\\le\\operatorname{ar}(f)})\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\Longleftrightarrow\nh\\in B^A\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in A^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}\\;\n\\bigl(h(I(f)(\\vec a))=J(f)((h(a_i))_{1\\le i\\le\\operatorname{ar}(f)})\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{HomSet}_{\\Sigma}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in B^A:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{HomSet}_{\\Sigma}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in B^A:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Iso}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\land h[A]=B\\land\\forall a,a&#39;\\in A\\;(h(a)=h(a&#39;)\\Longrightarrow a=a&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Iso}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\land h[A]=B\\land\\forall a,a&#39;\\in A\\;(h(a)=h(a&#39;)\\Longrightarrow a=a&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\cong_{\\Sigma}\\mathfrak B\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists h\\in B^A\\;\\operatorname{Iso}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathfrak A\\cong_{\\Sigma}\\mathfrak B\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists h\\in B^A\\;\\operatorname{Iso}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应 Definition 7.2.1(i)。同态保持每个命名运算，零元情形就是保持常元。这里只量化具体载体之间的集合函数，不构造所有代数的集合。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese, <em>Term Rewriting Systems</em>, Cambridge University Press, 2003，7.2.1(i)，印刷页 266。<code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 为本地DjVu文字层页块序号，不是物理扫描页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3544e74f0e48d8ac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3544e74f0e48d8ac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$，$\\mathfrak A=(A,I)$、$\\mathfrak B=(B,J)$ 为 [[56-df-structure]] 的非空 $\\Sigma$-代数。$B^A$ 为所有 $A\\to B$ 函数的集合，$h\\in B^A$。记 $\\vec a=(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)$，函数作用于元组的写法包含零元输入 $()$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A=(A,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak B=(B,J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"B^A","display":false},{"tex":"A\\to B","display":false},{"tex":"h\\in B^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\vec a=(a_1,\\ldots,a_n)","display":false},{"tex":"()","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\Longleftrightarrow\nh\\in B^A\\land\\forall f\\in F\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in A^{\\operatorname{ar}(f)}\\;\n\\bigl(h(I(f)(\\vec a))=J(f)((h(a_i))_{1\\le i\\le\\operatorname{ar}(f)})\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{HomSet}_{\\Sigma}(\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B)\\coloneqq\\{h\\in B^A:\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Iso}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)\\land h[A]=B\\land\\forall a,a'\\in A\\;(h(a)=h(a')\\Longrightarrow a=a').","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A\\cong_{\\Sigma}\\mathfrak B\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists h\\in B^A\\;\\operatorname{Iso}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h).","display":true}],"bytes":1792,"backlinks":[{"id":"a0a8374d48d26bd5","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$、$V$ 为固定变量集、$E\\subseteq\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)^2$，$\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)$。模型谓词和同态分别见 [[56-df-satisfaction]]、[[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]。$B$ 在集合论元语言中取遍非空集合，$J$ 取遍下式指定的全运算解释族；$B^0=\\{()\\}$。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-247","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-sigma-homomorphism.md]]"},{"id":"711a8fd18e306f8a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)$、$\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(B,J)$，且 $\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,B,J,h)$，见 [[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]。$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)$、$\\beta\\in A^V$、$t\\in T$；项解释见 [[56-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"3b81403d289d8fbb","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设同一 $\\Sigma,V,E$ 下 $\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,E}(A,I)$ 与 $\\operatorname{Initial}_{\\Sigma,V,E}(B,J)$，见 [[56-df-initial-algebra]]。同态、同构见 [[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]。"},{"id":"ee77de74c708cdc0","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"设 $\\operatorname{Algebra}_{\\Sigma}(A,I)$、$\\operatorname{Cong}_{\\Sigma}(A,I,Q)$。$(A/Q,I_Q)$、$[a]_Q$、$q_Q$ 取 [[56-df-quotient-algebra]]，同态取 [[56-df-sigma-homomorphism]]；$\\Sigma=(F,\\operatorname{ar})$。"},{"id":"5f19d760d9e98dce","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["3544e74f0e48d8ac"]}